cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "acwr: acute:chronic workload ratios in Python, with diagnostics for the metric itself"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata. If you use a particular ratio method, cite its original source as well; the README lists them."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aditya
    family-names: Garg
